From dc938965642c996d092c4ec5140112fd28a9c0e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ho=C3=A0?= <huyhoa308@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:25:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(board): add esp32s3-weact-dog (RoboEyes on ILI9341,
 INMP441 + I2S amp, 4 servo legs)

- EyesDisplay: RoboEyes port drawing into a PSRAM RGB565 canvas, dirty-box DMA push
- LegServos: staggered, slew-limited, auto-detaching symbolic leg motions
- DogBehavior: state/emotion tables driving eyes and legs
- DogAudioCodec: simplex I2S with amp SD pin and conservative default volume

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011zeGQ7CYtkKwrDgf89CB3X
